{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bAll characters involved in sexual content are over the age of 18.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bThere are no R18 elements in this work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\uff1cAbout\uff1e</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>After their glamorous night, the bunnies begin their dangerous journey home!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A spin-off of the &quot;Bunny Garden&quot; that charmed gentlemen across the world, is available now as an action game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control &quot;woozy&quot; cast members who can't walk properly and return home avoiding dangers that await!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is to safely escort these &quot;woozy&quot; cast members home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\uff1cStory\uff1e</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Bunny Garden&quot;, a paradise where gentleman can relax after daily fatigue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is another story that occurs after business hours...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kana, Rin and Miuka had an amazing time at Bunny Garden tonight as per usual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it seems as though they had one too many drinks tonight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So drunk to the point of their heads spinning, and not being able to stand straight...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But regardless of their condition, they had to go home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They have to meet the gentlemen again tomorrow at Bunny Garden with smiles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, as if to shatter the girls' hopes and dreams,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >tons of traps await on their way home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Kana, Rin and Miuka be able to make it home safely tonight?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\uff1cSystem\uff1e</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0Will the woozy cast be able to return home safely?!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player's mission is to guide the staggering cast safely back home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid all dangers lurking in the city at night, all while &quot;woozy&quot; where even walking straight is difficult!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steps, cars, bicycles and various other obstacles... Not to mention your clothes getting ripped...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're not careful it might be Game Over before you know it!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cast's survival all depends on you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0Happenings await!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crashing into trash cans and getting stuck, falling butt first into manholes...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are plenty of accidents on the way home!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome the troubles that await you and return the staggering cast home safely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\uff1cCHARACTER\uff1e</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbKana\u3000\u3000(Voice :Mio Hoshitani\uff09 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbRin\u3000\u3000\u3000(Voice :Eri Suzuki\uff09 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbMiuka\u3000(Voice :Masumi Tazawa\uff09 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\uff1cSTAFF\uff1e</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbCharacter Design:Waon Inui </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbScenario:Takayoshi Muto\uff08Synthese\uff09 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbProducer:Yujiro Usuda</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Bunny Garden!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3575730/13dfd65